  "solution": "__**BODMAS RULE**__:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ebadc30a979bf1a7e953d20901c3e7953c575296c0e0bb4af8a458ec3a64ab2c.png] \n\nWe check each option.\n\n**Option (1): **+ and -\n\nGiven equation: 18 ÷ 9 + 12 × 4 - 8 = 15\n\nAfter the sign interchange, new equation is: 18 ÷ 9 - 12 × 4 + 8 = 15\n\n​⇒ __**18 ÷ 9**__ - 12 × 4 + 8 = 15\n\n​⇒ 2 - __**12 × 4 **__+ 8 = 15\n\n​⇒ __**2**__ - 48 __**+ 8 **__= 15\n\n​⇒ 10 - 48 = 15\n\n**-38 ≠ 15**\n\n**LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nOption (2): ÷ and ×\n\nGiven equation: 18 ÷ 9 + 12 × 4 - 8 = 15\n\nAfter the sign interchange, new equation is: 18 × 9 - 12 ÷ 4 + 8 = 15\n\n​⇒ 18 × 9 - __**12 **____**÷ **____**4**__ + 8 = 15\n\n​⇒ __**18 × 9**__ - 3 + 8 = 15\n\n​⇒ __**162**__ - 3 __**+ 8**__** **+ 15\n\n​⇒ __**170 - 3**__ = 15\n\n167 ≠ 15\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption (3): × and -\n\nGiven equation: 18 ÷ 9 + 12 × 4 - 8 = 15\n\nAfter the sign interchange, new equation is: 18 ÷ 9 + 12 - 4 × 8 = 15\n\n​⇒ __**18 ÷ 9**__ + 12 - 4 × 8 = 15\n\n​⇒ 2 + 12 - __**4 **____**×**____** 8**__ = 15\n\n​⇒ __**2 + 12**__ - 32 = 15\n\n​⇒ 14 - 32 = 15\n\n-18 ≠ 15\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption (4): - and ÷\n\nGiven equation: 18 ÷ 9 + 12 × 4 - 8 = 15\n\nAfter the sign interchange, new equation is: 18 - 9 + 12 × 4 ÷ 8 = 15\n\n​⇒ 18 - 9 + 12 × __**4 **____**÷**____** 8 **__= 15\n\n​⇒ 18 - 9 + __**12 × 0.5**__** **= 15\n\n​⇒ **__1__****__8__** - 9 __**+ 6**__ = 15​\n\n​⇒ __**24 - 9**__ = 15\n\n**15 = 15**\n\n**LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**- and ÷**\".\n\na0:T1e76,\n\n<",
